      "created_at": "2014-10-15T19:10:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I found no questions on it from playtesting, but I would guess it is the intent.</p><p>It's the main reason The Contract works like she does, you summon thugs away from you if possible.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I guess the Thugs are rowdy enough that you want to be careful once you set them loose.</p>",
